      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 13,
          "verse": 6
        }
      ],
      "en": "The land was not able to bear them, that they might live together; for their possessions were so great that they couldn’t live together.",
      "ko": "그 땅이 그들의 동거함을 용납지 못하였으니 곧 그들의 소유가 많아서 동거할 수 없었음이라",
      "source_text_hash": "a4f8880d214661ddc86dafa559d4b155cb954d6d693558e43f2473cfb5c1b808",
      "translation_text_hash": "9f4a84da285b1845f28b55486a31a1dd7aa086ec2cc33dff7b4eed9d24ca5d8d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
