      "ko": "소돔 사람은 악하여 여호와 앞에 큰 죄인이었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "1b5b358842595abb290d642af6155b784e531eb955f80ab79e11333043d8bce0",
      "translation_text_hash": "9d3505a5e3fabd9e847233bc0cf9af6c419459e991a8993bf653b2f1b1d42bc4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
